      "writtenOn": "2025-09-24T01:59:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right, this is timing issue. \nIn motionsense_init() to check clamshell mode to do gmr_tablet_switch_disable(), this priority is used HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT. \n\nBut disable keyboard scan is in gmr_tablet_switch_init of lid_angle_peripheral_enable(0) which used HOOK_PRIO_POST_LID, this timing is early motionsense_init(). Cause KB scan disable cannot scan refresh key.\nI think we can change the gmr_tablet_switch_init priority to later than motionsense_init(). Please let me know for more advise.",
